{"seconds": 27.0, "exit": 0, "final": "Excellent! **Qc3+** wins material decisively. Black either:\n1. Forces the king to move, then captures the queen with Qxc2+, winning the queen\n2. Or if White captures with Rxc3, Black plays Bg3+ forking the king and rook\n\nThis is a **fork**\u2014the queen on c3 attacks both the White queen and rook simultaneously, both undefended.\n\n**Coaching note:** When your queen can give check and simultaneously attack an undefended piece (especially a high-value one), look carefully\u2014it's often a knight fork pattern but with the queen. Both the queen on c2 and rook on h3 are on the same rank relative to c3; the queen pins itself to its own defense of c2.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Qc3+\", \"line\": [\"Qc3+\", \"Kf2\", \"Qxc2+\", \"Kf3\", \"Qxb3\", \"Kg4\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "f6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "f4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "h3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "c2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "square": "e1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - - 3 54", "move": "Qc3+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/6k1/p2p1q2/1p4p1/5b2/PP5R/2Q5/4K3 b - 